{"id":"01a03edb-1174-7557-9a84-4c189ed85cfd","issue_id":"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.5.6.6.1","event_type":"updated","actor":"Mark Atwood","old_value":"{\"id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.5.6.6.1\",\"title\":\"Python: SRH encode/decode\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"priority\":1,\"issue_type\":\"task\",\"assignee\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"owner\":\"me@mark.atwood.name\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-25T03:44:29.566602Z\",\"created_by\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-26T16:12:30.857536Z\",\"started_at\":\"2026-08-26T01:51:42.035301Z\",\"lease_expires_at\":\"2026-08-26T16:17:30.857536Z\",\"heartbeat_at\":\"2026-08-26T16:12:30.857536Z\",\"dependencies\":[{\"issue_id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.5.6.6.1\",\"depends_on_id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.5.6.6\",\"type\":\"parent-child\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-25T03:44:30.04747Z\",\"created_by\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"metadata\":\"{}\"}]}","new_value":"{\"notes\":\"Implemented RFC 6554 full-address SRH decode validation in Python: explicitly parses and rejects unsupported nonzero CmprI/CmprE, rejects nonzero Pad for the uncompressed profile, ignores Reserved bits as RFC-required while canonicalizing them to zero on encode, and rejects non-Routing extension wrappers. Added deterministic regressions for truncated fixed fields, compressed address modes, pad values, reserved-bit acceptance, misaligned address vectors, empty/zero-segment round trips, wrong wrapper types, and exact RFC 8200 Hdr Ext Len serialization. Verification green: full python/tests/rpl 650 passed (one unrelated pytest deprecation warning); relay SRH/source-route subset 8 passed, 35 deselected; Ruff passed; mypy passed; git diff --check passed. No forwarding/C/Zephyr scope added.\"}","created_at":"2026-08-26T16:15:39.38035Z"}
